4753
06:00:09,080 --> 06:00:10,080
 this looks like for SDRs.

4754
06:00:10,080 --> 06:00:14,080
 So starting out, when I was using AI, I was just prompting back and back and forth.

4755
06:00:14,080 --> 06:00:18,080
 And I wanted to kind of dive into the actual AI maturity curve and what this looks like for

4756
06:00:18,080 --> 06:00:19,080
 SDRs.

4757
06:00:19,080 --> 06:00:33,080
 So starting out, when I was using AI, I was just prompting back and forth with a chatbot.

4758
06:00:33,080 --> 06:00:34,080
 I'd do typical things.

4759
06:00:34,080 --> 06:00:39,080
 Like, I'd ask, can you help me actually draft this email or kind of perfect this copy or do this

4760
06:00:39,080 --> 06:00:42,080
 account research for this specific account I'm looking at.

4761
06:00:42,080 --> 06:00:47,080
 And what we've seen kind of progress over the last year is first the idea of co-pilots.

4762
06:00:47,080 --> 06:00:52,080
 And so co-pilots are AI that can actually go out and carry out a true task.

4763
06:00:52,080 --> 06:00:57,080
 So instead of talking back and forth, getting email copy and then copying that into your Gmail,

4764
06:00:57,080 --> 06:01:04,080
 it's something now that we see like actually having the AI go and basically hook up to a Gmail MCP or an API

4765
06:01:04,080 --> 06:01:06,080
 and be able to actually send that email off for you.

4766
06:01:06,080 --> 06:01:15,080
 And really with bot, what we believe is kind of the next frontier is actually automating entire jobs in full.

4767
06:01:15,080 --> 06:01:19,080
 And so going beyond just a task and actually doing an end-to-end workflow.

4768
06:01:19,080 --> 06:01:25,080
 And really with the staff function of actually combining a team of bots, you can see how kind of automating a job,

4769
06:01:25,080 --> 06:01:32,080
 but also combining that with different features of business like talking to RevOps or talking to your AE and getting context on an account.

4770
06:01:32,080 --> 06:01:37,080
 And how bots can actually pull in that context for you and really help you do that full process.

4771
