06:07:10,080 --> 06:07:12,080
 What's the most optimal way to reach my goal?

4833
06:07:12,080 --> 06:07:16,080
 And personally as an SDR for me, that's how many S1s can I get?

4834
06:07:16,080 --> 06:07:18,080
 And so you can kind of reverse engineer from that point.

4835
06:07:18,080 --> 06:07:21,080
