06:07:27,080 --> 06:07:30,080
 So you can use enrichment tools, set those up within grok bot.

4838
06:07:30,080 --> 06:07:40,080
 You can also use web search to kind of find more specific data like job postings or any funding announcements from some of your target companies and really just bring this all in.

