06:07:45,080 --> 06:07:51,080
 And so really what I've done within my own grok bot instance is I build kind of an ongoing list of all my prospects.

4841
06:07:51,080 --> 06:08:01,080
 And this lives as a CSV today, but really what I think is nuanced about this is you can have things like grok bot routines and automations, which are constantly updating this.

