06:12:34,080 --> 06:12:41,080
 And then I have web search, which obviously is just doing web research, but he actually works in parallel with my Simon soldier.

4892
06:12:41,080 --> 06:12:52,080
 And I'll show you, I basically have an entire army of Simon soldiers, which I basically consider sub agents or sub bots that when web search wants to delegate a task across say 50 or 100 counts.

4893
06:12:53,080 --> 06:12:58,080
 The scalable way to do that is actually creating sub bots that basically respond directly to web search.

