5140
06:31:56,080 --> 06:31:59,080
 And I think that's really what differentiates GrokBot.

5141
06:31:59,080 --> 06:32:02,080
 And what makes it a true like force multiplier for SDRs.

5142
06:32:02,080 --> 06:32:05,080
 So I really emphasize like thinking at a high level.

5143
06:32:05,080 --> 06:32:08,080
 And kind of thinking how you can actually build that system.

5144
06:32:08,080 --> 06:32:10,080
 And I think on that same note.

5145
06:32:10,080 --> 06:32:12,080
