6607
07:59:12,760 --> 07:59:16,160
 You can also scope permissions to your different bots.

6608
07:59:16,160 --> 07:59:24,900
 So one bot might have permission to post automatically to Slack, one might not and make them approve those actions before they do them.

6609
07:59:24,900 --> 07:59:26,600
 Second, start simple.

6610
07:59:26,600 --> 07:59:28,500
 So the whole product is still so new.

6611
07:59:28,500 --> 07:59:32,300
 I don't think there's one meta or one clear playbook.

6612
07:59:32,300 --> 07:59:34,900
 And the product is meant to be very flexible.

6613
07:59:34,900 --> 07:59:41,960
 So try to make the bots fit into how you work and not vice versa.

6614
07:59:41,960 --> 07:59:44,560
