6645
08:02:49,600 --> 08:02:54,600
 Tell it to like create a table for eval runs or for a set of evals.

6646
08:02:54,600 --> 08:02:57,600
 So things you want to test every single time you like make a change.

6647
08:02:57,600 --> 08:02:59,600
 And then another table for traces.

6648
08:02:59,600 --> 08:03:08,600
 So every time reply runs, I ask it how long it took, what files it looked at, what files it ended up choosing to reply.

6649
08:03:08,600 --> 08:03:10,600
 So usually it's like a filtered down list.

6650
08:03:10,600 --> 08:03:18,600
 And then from there you can usually decipher where it went wrong or things like that.

6651
08:03:18,600 --> 08:03:22,600
