6657
08:03:41,600 --> 08:03:44,600
 Create traces and evals table.

6658
08:03:44,600 --> 08:03:48,600
 Write to those tables every time I ask you to run an eval or create a new eval.

6659
08:03:48,600 --> 08:03:58,600
